# Evidence files live in this directory.
#
# Naming: {scenario-slug}-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md
# Example: claude-code-auto-memory-2026-06-15.md
#
# Each file has frontmatter:
#   ---
#   scenario: claude-code-auto-memory
#   date: YYYY-MM-DD
#   status: running | paused | abandoned
#   session_focus: "<short text>"
#   ---
#
# Body sections (any order, all optional but logging empty ones is suspicious):
#   ## What we did
#   ## DX pains encountered
#   ## API gaps surfaced
#   ## Next session goal
#
# Create via `/dogfood log-evidence`. See ../manifest.md for the active scenarios.
